WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:41.750 --> 00:00:45.963
"Minister Kim's Dream Life"

2
00:01:00.227 --> 00:01:01.645
(Executive Director Kim Nak-soo)

3
00:01:18.203 --> 00:01:19.413
How does it feel?

4
00:01:22.124 --> 00:01:23.250
I don't care at all

5
00:01:24.918 --> 00:01:25.794
Really?

6
00:01:27.212 --> 00:01:28.380
That's good

7
00:01:31.925 --> 00:01:33.802
This is where it all begins

8
00:01:34.386 --> 00:01:38.015
You hit that one
A hole-in-one that I shouldn’t have had in my life

9
00:01:38.599 --> 00:01:41.810
From that point on, everything started to go downhill.

10
00:01:44.855 --> 00:01:46.064
Take a look

11
00:01:46.732 --> 00:01:48.650
{\an8}Kim Nak-soo Executive Director

12
00:01:50.777 --> 00:01:52.029
(Executive Director Kim Nak-soo)

13
00:01:53.280 --> 00:01:55.407
This could have been achieved

14
00:01:58.285 --> 00:01:59.536
What are you going to do?

15
00:02:00.370 --> 00:02:02.331
You were laid off by the company and your severance pay was wasted.

16
00:02:02.414 --> 00:02:04.333
There are still many days ahead

17
00:02:04.875 --> 00:02:08.712
I have to pay back several million won every month, right?

18
00:02:12.341 --> 00:02:13.675
I just want to be like this

19
00:02:15.552 --> 00:02:16.970
Just deal with the problems one by one.

20
00:02:18.013 --> 00:02:19.306
i can do it

21
00:02:19.389 --> 00:02:21.433
Continue with contemporary driving?

22
00:02:22.059 --> 00:02:24.186
Squeeze money out of your teeth to pay interest?

23
00:02:24.269 --> 00:02:26.772
Do you think you can really endure this kind of life?

24
00:02:28.231 --> 00:02:29.107
No

25
00:02:30.817 --> 00:02:31.902
Luo Zhu

26
00:02:32.527 --> 00:02:33.820
You can't hold it

27
00:02:36.281 --> 00:02:37.199
Live this kind of life

28
00:02:38.492 --> 00:02:42.371
you can never be happy

29
00:02:49.169 --> 00:02:50.045
We'll see

30
00:02:51.296 --> 00:02:52.881
Let's see who is right in the end

31
00:03:22.327 --> 00:03:25.872
{\an8}Oh my God, this wall is seriously affected by moisture.

32
00:03:25.956 --> 00:03:28.792
{\an8}It’s all the fault of the previous tenant’s lack of ventilation.

33
00:03:28.875 --> 00:03:30.961
{\an8}Just repost the wallpaper and it will look brand new.

34
00:03:31.044 --> 00:03:33.255
{\an8}How much do you think the rent here is?

35
00:03:33.338 --> 00:03:35.632
{\an8}Deposit 100 million, monthly rent 1.6 million

36
00:03:37.759 --> 00:03:40.345
{\an8}If the deposit is increased to 200 million
The monthly rent can be reduced to 1.3 million

37
00:03:40.429 --> 00:03:44.141
{\an8}I’m afraid the deposit cannot be increased any more.

38
00:03:44.224 --> 00:03:47.227
{\an8}Ms. If this is beyond your budget

39
00:03:48.019 --> 00:03:50.021
{\an8}Then I’m afraid we have to consider places other than Seoul.

40
00:03:52.691 --> 00:03:54.151
{\an8}Okay

41
00:03:57.404 --> 00:03:59.781
Sir, I'll be there soon

42
00:03:59.865 --> 00:04:02.743
We have come in and are looking at the house

43
00:04:04.035 --> 00:04:05.871
- Really?
- We arrived a little early

44
00:04:05.954 --> 00:04:07.998
So I rang the doorbell to see if anyone was in the house.

45
00:04:08.081 --> 00:04:09.916
Turns out your husband is at home

46
00:04:15.922 --> 00:04:16.798
Wife, you are back

47
00:04:19.176 --> 00:04:20.719
Let me continue

48
00:04:20.802 --> 00:04:23.805
Whenever the children upstairs make a thumping noise

49
00:04:23.889 --> 00:04:27.267
I will always sigh: "Time flies so fast
They have grown so big.”

50
00:04:27.350 --> 00:04:30.937
And the neighbor next door kept coughing all night long.

51
00:04:31.021 --> 00:04:33.190
- It's really heart-wrenching to hear.
- Can you hear these?

52
00:04:33.273 --> 00:04:35.066
Of course, I can hear everything clearly.

53
00:04:35.150 --> 00:04:37.319
How much are the property fees?

54
00:04:37.402 --> 00:04:39.279
- Property fees...
- Property fees?

55
00:04:39.362 --> 00:04:42.616
If you wear a down jacket in winter, it won’t be too cold.

56
00:04:43.366 --> 00:04:44.367
No

57
00:04:44.451 --> 00:04:46.453
Let me give you a detailed introduction.

58
00:04:46.536 --> 00:04:47.496
Have you looked at the kitchen?

59
00:04:47.579 --> 00:04:49.122
- I've already introduced
- No thanks

60
00:04:51.041 --> 00:04:53.460
Take a closer look. This house is really nice.

61
00:04:53.543 --> 00:04:55.253
OK I will contact you

62
00:04:55.337 --> 00:04:57.506
Okay, then I'll wait for your news

63
00:05:07.182 --> 00:05:09.184
I said I can solve it

64
00:05:09.810 --> 00:05:10.727
Removal of listings

65
00:05:10.811 --> 00:05:11.937
Husband

66
00:05:15.148 --> 00:05:16.525
I don't sell my house

67
00:05:18.068 --> 00:05:19.069
answer me

68
00:05:20.862 --> 00:05:22.113
answer me

69
00:05:36.837 --> 00:05:39.422
It's not like that. I can't get any orders at all.

70
00:05:39.506 --> 00:05:42.050
Master, I checked the system

71
00:05:42.133 --> 00:05:43.969
Shows you have a recent accident record

72
00:05:44.052 --> 00:05:46.847
But I have already gone through the insurance process
Everything is taken care of

73
00:05:46.930 --> 00:05:49.850
Yes but incident records or complaints

74
00:05:49.933 --> 00:05:52.185
Will affect the order dispatch algorithm

75
00:05:52.269 --> 00:05:55.480
Sorry, there's nothing we can do

76
00:05:55.564 --> 00:05:57.107
Damn it

77
00:05:58.900 --> 00:06:00.151
What the hell

78
00:06:12.914 --> 00:06:13.999
OK

79
00:06:14.833 --> 00:06:16.459
It's very clean inside

80
00:06:17.210 --> 00:06:18.712
About 24 million to 25 million won?

81
00:06:18.795 --> 00:06:21.381
I know a car dealer
Try to help you get the highest price. What do you think?

82
00:06:25.468 --> 00:06:26.469
OK

83
00:06:30.348 --> 00:06:31.516
Then I'll call him tomorrow

84
00:06:33.518 --> 00:06:36.021
I still have some work to finish in my office

85
00:06:36.104 --> 00:06:37.606
You empty the car.

86
00:06:37.689 --> 00:06:39.900
Can I use your car wash tools?

87
00:06:41.443 --> 00:06:42.485
OK, use it

88
00:06:48.825 --> 00:06:50.869
I couldn’t take you to the beach on weekends either

89
00:06:50.952 --> 00:06:54.497
The whole day is work and home. Two o'clock and one line. I'm sorry.

90
00:06:57.000 --> 00:06:58.543
Thank you for your hard work

91
00:07:04.633 --> 00:07:06.092
Are you still doing it?

92
00:07:06.176 --> 00:07:08.720
- That's almost it. Let's go.
- Got it

93
00:07:09.346 --> 00:07:11.932
Anyway, it's going to be sold tomorrow, so just dust it off.

94
00:07:12.015 --> 00:07:13.600
It'll be ready soon

95
00:07:18.647 --> 00:07:21.149
- Want to help?
- No need

96
00:07:21.232 --> 00:07:22.192
So be it

97
00:07:22.275 --> 00:07:24.361
I'll turn off the lights. You go first.

98
00:07:24.444 --> 00:07:25.570
I'll lock the door later

99
00:07:25.654 --> 00:07:28.073
You kid suddenly came here in the middle of the night...

100
00:07:30.116 --> 00:07:31.117
You go first

101
00:08:32.137 --> 00:08:36.474
- Episode 11:
-B+

102
00:08:36.558 --> 00:08:37.809
(ACT Building 1, ACT Building 2)

103
00:08:38.018 --> 00:08:39.811
It's a pity, but there's nothing we can do about it

104
00:08:40.562 --> 00:08:43.606
Then this time we will play by ourselves

105
00:08:45.150 --> 00:08:46.401
yes of course

106
00:08:49.571 --> 00:08:51.364
this guy

107
00:08:58.204 --> 00:09:00.623
- Executive Bai?
- Hello, Manager Yin

108
00:09:01.791 --> 00:09:06.588
We’re playing golf this week. LK’s CEO Choi won’t be able to come.

109
00:09:07.213 --> 00:09:08.923
Do you want to bring anyone with you...

110
00:09:09.007 --> 00:09:11.092
Actually I was about to call you

111
00:09:11.176 --> 00:09:14.721
Sorry, I'm afraid I won't be able to go this time either.

112
00:09:17.265 --> 00:09:18.266
Really?

113
00:09:18.349 --> 00:09:20.018
Really that...

114
00:09:20.101 --> 00:09:22.353
Contact Mr. Bai again

115
00:09:22.854 --> 00:09:24.397
Okay, I understand...

116
00:09:24.481 --> 00:09:25.648
Hello...

117
00:09:28.109 --> 00:09:29.527
(TU Executive Director Yin)

118
00:09:29.611 --> 00:09:30.612
I told Executive Bai

119
00:09:30.695 --> 00:09:32.989
...mainly due to phone anxiety

120
00:09:33.073 --> 00:09:38.453
In other words, they are resistant to unsolicited calls

121
00:09:38.536 --> 00:09:39.704
(ok thank you)

122
00:09:39.788 --> 00:09:41.915
In fact, surveys of Gen MZ show...

123
00:09:42.791 --> 00:09:44.876
- let me go
- wait a minute

124
00:09:53.510 --> 00:09:54.552
What's going on?

125
00:09:58.431 --> 00:09:59.307
Soyeon continue

126
00:10:01.226 --> 00:10:03.186
Chengjiu, what are you doing?

127
00:10:03.269 --> 00:10:05.021
Let's go to the meeting

128
00:10:05.105 --> 00:10:07.357
This is next year's sales strategy meeting, right?

129
00:10:07.440 --> 00:10:08.691
Aren’t we team members?

130
00:10:08.775 --> 00:10:10.485
Aren't you our team leader?

131
00:10:10.568 --> 00:10:11.820
Sorry, Minister

132
00:10:11.903 --> 00:10:12.904
Naruhisa

133
00:10:13.488 --> 00:10:14.364
let's go

134
00:10:15.782 --> 00:10:16.950
Agent Zheng

135
00:10:17.534 --> 00:10:20.662
I know you were unhappy with your recent performance review but...

136
00:10:20.745 --> 00:10:22.580
Not a question of performance evaluation

137
00:10:24.415 --> 00:10:27.335
It's because I'm fed up with being treated like a transparent talent.

138
00:10:31.673 --> 00:10:33.299
Mr. Song, do you think so too?

139
00:10:36.845 --> 00:10:39.556
recent months
The only time we walked into this conference room

140
00:10:40.890 --> 00:10:44.018
It’s Minister Kim Nak-soo who represents the external company.
The time I came to make a proposal

141
00:10:44.102 --> 00:10:45.562
It's getting more and more excessive

142
00:10:45.645 --> 00:10:48.731
Do you know what you are doing?

143
00:10:48.815 --> 00:10:50.316
- Insolent
- Deputy Chief Shen

144
00:10:50.942 --> 00:10:51.860
Stop talking

145
00:10:55.363 --> 00:10:59.367
It seems my negligence

146
00:10:59.450 --> 00:11:01.911
Okay, let's have a meeting together

147
00:11:01.995 --> 00:11:03.246
Take a seat

148
00:11:04.914 --> 00:11:05.999
Soyeon please continue

149
00:11:07.167 --> 00:11:08.459
good

150
00:11:09.085 --> 00:11:13.464
Therefore, we will significantly reduce the monthly fee for unlimited plans

151
00:11:13.548 --> 00:11:15.967
- But limit voice call duration to...
- Songxi

152
00:11:16.050 --> 00:11:18.887
can you give a rough estimate
People in their twenties and thirties by gender and time period

153
00:11:18.970 --> 00:11:20.388
Average data usage?

154
00:11:21.139 --> 00:11:22.348
What?

155
00:11:23.683 --> 00:11:25.727
I didn't bring my laptop...

156
00:11:25.810 --> 00:11:26.728
i know

157
00:11:27.395 --> 00:11:28.980
I said "rough estimate"

158
00:11:30.190 --> 00:11:32.066
So you can’t answer without looking at the data.

159
00:11:33.526 --> 00:11:36.070
Agent Zheng, can you introduce your competitors?

160
00:11:36.154 --> 00:11:38.865
OTT bundled packages to be launched early next year?

161
00:11:39.407 --> 00:11:42.243
You brought a computer and you can watch and talk at the same time

162
00:11:47.707 --> 00:11:50.376
First of all, people in their twenties and thirties
Women use half as much data...

163
00:11:50.460 --> 00:11:51.336
Section Chief Song

164
00:11:52.295 --> 00:11:54.005
Based on your position

165
00:11:54.088 --> 00:11:56.841
You are the only one in the team who can report smoothly

166
00:11:56.925 --> 00:11:58.343
You should be ashamed

167
00:11:59.260 --> 00:12:01.346
I had good intentions

168
00:12:01.429 --> 00:12:03.473
Allow time for groups one and two

169
00:12:03.556 --> 00:12:06.893
Focus on core business and develop independent analysis capabilities

170
00:12:06.976 --> 00:12:08.686
In your eyes, it becomes unfair treatment

171
00:12:08.770 --> 00:12:10.521
I'm still upset. It really makes me...

172
00:12:12.815 --> 00:12:13.816
chilling

173
00:12:14.359 --> 00:12:15.443
To be honest

174
00:12:16.569 --> 00:12:20.573
I'm also worried
How to lead the sales department?

175
00:12:26.037 --> 00:12:26.955
Executive Bai, you are here

176
00:12:27.038 --> 00:12:28.581
- Good routine
- Good routine

177
00:12:30.250 --> 00:12:31.209
What's going on?

178
00:12:32.293 --> 00:12:34.337
- Why is the atmosphere so tense?
- Sorry, Executive

179
00:12:35.380 --> 00:12:37.674
Please let me finish what I just said

180
00:12:39.092 --> 00:12:42.804
Everyone, this is not a club, this is a workplace.

181
00:12:43.596 --> 00:12:46.641
Instead of complaining about being treated unfairly

182
00:12:47.934 --> 00:12:50.103
It’s better to focus on improving professional abilities

183
00:12:50.186 --> 00:12:52.188
Wouldn’t it be more rewarding?

184
00:12:54.440 --> 00:12:56.567
I will continue to pay attention to your performance

185
00:12:57.735 --> 00:13:00.321
But please leave first today

186
00:13:11.291 --> 00:13:14.127
Executive Bai, if it’s convenient, please give me seating guidance.

187
00:13:16.087 --> 00:13:17.839
Soyeon, go ahead

188
00:13:18.631 --> 00:13:21.509
Okay, I'll report on

189
00:13:21.592 --> 00:13:23.845
63% of Generation MZ said

190
00:13:23.928 --> 00:13:27.682
Prefer instant messaging software to making phone calls

191
00:13:27.765 --> 00:13:30.977
Based on this, we can package OTT value-added services

192
00:13:31.060 --> 00:13:33.771
Effectively guide data usage growth

193
00:13:33.855 --> 00:13:35.815
The transmission belt is also scrapped. What should I do?

194
00:13:35.898 --> 00:13:37.191
Leave it first

195
00:13:37.275 --> 00:13:38.318
- Remind me later
- OK

196
00:13:38.401 --> 00:13:39.360
Boss, that's ok

197
00:13:39.444 --> 00:13:41.487
Next time besides changing the tires, let's also do a checkup.

198
00:13:41.571 --> 00:13:43.448
- We are also good at imported cars
- OK

199
00:13:43.531 --> 00:13:45.742
All genuine parts are used and the prices are reasonable.

200
00:13:46.284 --> 00:13:47.243
You walk slowly

201
00:13:47.327 --> 00:13:49.579
(Speedmate Auto Repair
Tire service (entrust with confidence)

202
00:13:49.704 --> 00:13:50.788
You walk slowly

203
00:13:54.375 --> 00:13:55.376
Luo Zhu

204
00:13:55.460 --> 00:13:57.462
- What?
- There's news from over there.

205
00:13:58.254 --> 00:13:59.756
Talk about your car

206
00:13:59.839 --> 00:14:01.841
The most they can offer is 20 million won

207
00:14:02.508 --> 00:14:03.426
Twenty million?

208
00:14:04.677 --> 00:14:06.554
This car is top-notch

209
00:14:06.637 --> 00:14:07.764
After all, it's an old model

210
00:14:07.847 --> 00:14:09.891
And the engine is almost out of warranty.

211
00:14:11.100 --> 00:14:12.393
Really

212
00:14:12.477 --> 00:14:13.895
What do you say?

213
00:14:15.813 --> 00:14:18.483
Ask others if they can get an extra million

214
00:14:20.693 --> 00:14:21.861
I'm leaving first

215
00:14:23.404 --> 00:14:24.280
hey

216
00:14:25.573 --> 00:14:26.908
Got it thank you

217
00:14:26.991 --> 00:14:28.451
I didn't mean that

218
00:14:29.118 --> 00:14:31.496
See this SUV? This is it

219
00:14:32.080 --> 00:14:34.749
You go and clean it

220
00:14:35.541 --> 00:14:36.459
What?

221
00:14:36.542 --> 00:14:39.128
After washing, wash the car that Haojun is repairing.

222
00:14:39.212 --> 00:14:42.048
Give me the energy to suck milk
It must be polished inside and out

223
00:14:43.466 --> 00:14:44.467
Why did you suddenly say this?

224
00:14:44.550 --> 00:14:46.302
I just...wait a minute

225
00:14:47.345 --> 00:14:49.430
You have come

226
00:14:49.514 --> 00:14:52.308
At least you can earn some traveling expenses before leaving. Take it.

227
00:14:52.392 --> 00:14:53.976
- Okay?
- What?

228
00:15:05.738 --> 00:15:06.656
Yes, Executive Bai

229
00:15:10.159 --> 00:15:11.786
this weekend

230
00:15:11.869 --> 00:15:14.330
Sales Head of the Three Major Telecommunications Companies
golf thing

231
00:15:14.956 --> 00:15:16.499
It seems the only option is to cancel

232
00:15:16.582 --> 00:15:18.292
They all say they can’t spare the time

233
00:15:18.793 --> 00:15:20.253
Really?

234
00:15:21.838 --> 00:15:23.381
That's a pity

235
00:15:24.090 --> 00:15:27.051
I will contact golf courses and Japanese food stores
Cancel reservation

236
00:15:28.928 --> 00:15:30.430
Do you really feel pity?

237
00:15:33.099 --> 00:15:34.016
What?

238
00:15:39.814 --> 00:15:40.815
Sorry, I'll take my leave now.

239
00:15:40.898 --> 00:15:41.774
(Specialist Huang Taishan)

240
00:15:41.858 --> 00:15:44.152
Wish you a pleasant meal Executive

241
00:15:45.194 --> 00:15:46.195
Is a professional

242
00:15:47.697 --> 00:15:49.824
Everyone has time this weekend

243
00:15:49.907 --> 00:15:51.033
yes

244
00:16:08.176 --> 00:16:09.844
What is Kim Nak-soo doing recently?

245
00:16:09.927 --> 00:16:10.887
What?

246
00:16:11.387 --> 00:16:12.763
- Are you asking about Minister Kim?
- Yes

247
00:16:12.847 --> 00:16:14.307
Which of you has contact with him?

248
00:16:18.227 --> 00:16:20.563
I invite you for the second round!

249
00:16:25.776 --> 00:16:27.236
Is there any contact?

250
00:16:27.320 --> 00:16:28.488
Probably not

251
00:16:30.281 --> 00:16:31.949
Really, I said you...

252
00:16:34.869 --> 00:16:36.120
Okay, let's go back to work.

253
00:16:38.873 --> 00:16:41.542
Why do you think he wanted to find Minister Kim?

254
00:16:42.960 --> 00:16:44.545
Hey you're back

255
00:16:45.087 --> 00:16:47.131
Boss, you washed my car

256
00:16:47.215 --> 00:16:48.966
You said you wouldn't be back for a while

257
00:16:49.050 --> 00:16:51.552
We had some time left after repairing the car, so we washed it.

258
00:16:52.345 --> 00:16:54.180
That guy washed it

259
00:16:54.263 --> 00:16:55.598
thank you

260
00:16:56.224 --> 00:16:58.768
He washes so cleanly

261
00:16:59.268 --> 00:17:00.394
How much should be paid?

262
00:17:01.187 --> 00:17:02.522
How much does it cost to wash a car?

263
00:17:03.439 --> 00:17:05.191
You are the boss and you have the final say

264
00:17:06.609 --> 00:17:07.777
No need to pay, free

265
00:17:08.402 --> 00:17:10.738
It’s so clean, so it doesn’t make sense not to pay, right?

266
00:17:10.821 --> 00:17:13.324
It's okay. I really don't need to pay you today.

267
00:17:13.407 --> 00:17:14.867
- Okay, I will come often
- OK

268
00:17:14.951 --> 00:17:16.869
- Thanks
- You walk slowly

269
00:17:17.662 --> 00:17:19.288
- OK
- Really

270
00:17:19.372 --> 00:17:20.289
You walk slowly

271
00:17:26.921 --> 00:17:29.382
What does "free" mean?

272
00:17:29.465 --> 00:17:31.300
Didn’t you say you wanted me to earn some traveling expenses?

273
00:17:35.388 --> 00:17:36.389
give

274
00:17:38.683 --> 00:17:39.559
Forget it

275
00:17:39.642 --> 00:17:41.310
You should earn at least this much

276
00:17:41.936 --> 00:17:42.937
It's all said and done

277
00:17:43.020 --> 00:17:45.147
What does it count? Take it

278
00:17:45.231 --> 00:17:46.983
Thanks to you, I got another regular customer

279
00:17:47.483 --> 00:17:48.526
It's really yours

280
00:17:52.697 --> 00:17:53.739
Luo Zhu

281
00:17:54.490 --> 00:17:55.408
What for?

282
00:17:55.908 --> 00:17:57.201
Do you want to give it a serious try?

283
00:17:58.828 --> 00:17:59.704
What to try?

284
00:18:02.957 --> 00:18:04.292
You want me to wash the car?

285
00:18:05.209 --> 00:18:07.295
- Is there any mistake?
- I mean it

286
00:18:07.378 --> 00:18:09.213
You are definitely made for this

287
00:18:09.297 --> 00:18:12.592
Waxing, interior steam cleaning, disinfection
Two and a half hours full service

288
00:18:12.675 --> 00:18:14.218
The price is 50,000 won?

289
00:18:14.885 --> 00:18:16.178
Only accept three orders a day

290
00:18:18.014 --> 00:18:19.432
We will provide you with formal work clothes

291
00:18:20.474 --> 00:18:23.019
It's important. You have to have that professional look.

292
00:18:23.769 --> 00:18:26.564
Don't hang around in your slippers like you did today

293
00:18:27.064 --> 00:18:28.482
Who said I was going to do it?

294
00:18:29.150 --> 00:18:30.026
hey

295
00:18:30.860 --> 00:18:34.322
Just shave your head
Don’t you have the feeling of being a craftsman?

296
00:18:35.281 --> 00:18:36.699
I said I won't do it

297
00:18:39.327 --> 00:18:40.369
I'm impressed with you

298
00:18:46.375 --> 00:18:47.585
50,000 times 3 equals 150,000

299
00:18:49.128 --> 00:18:50.880
150,000 times 22 equals...

300
00:18:53.507 --> 00:18:55.259
150,000 times 22

301
00:18:57.470 --> 00:18:58.554
It’s 3.3 million

302
00:19:15.279 --> 00:19:16.322
What are you doing?

303
00:19:19.116 --> 00:19:20.534
Help me get my phone

304
00:19:24.121 --> 00:19:25.956
(Executive Director Bai Zhengtai)

305
00:19:33.464 --> 00:19:34.465
give

306
00:19:39.637 --> 00:19:42.306
- Take it
- No need

307
00:19:42.390 --> 00:19:44.600
Is it because I'm here that you didn't answer?

308
00:19:45.726 --> 00:19:46.977
What did you say?

309
00:19:48.521 --> 00:19:49.980
(Executive Director Bai Zhengtai)

310
00:19:56.862 --> 00:19:57.822
I...

311
00:19:59.281 --> 00:20:00.741
Start working tomorrow

312
00:20:01.367 --> 00:20:02.284
Where?

313
00:20:03.244 --> 00:20:05.204
My brother's car repair shop

314
00:20:05.287 --> 00:20:06.330
Where's the uncle?

315
00:20:07.081 --> 00:20:08.290
What do you do?

316
00:20:08.374 --> 00:20:09.542
Anyway, there is work to do

317
00:20:11.001 --> 00:20:12.545
What can you do there?

318
00:20:12.628 --> 00:20:14.714
Are you going to do something dangerous again?

319
00:20:15.756 --> 00:20:17.842
No

320
00:20:19.176 --> 00:20:20.678
I'm going to wash the car

321
00:20:36.110 --> 00:20:37.528
Do you want to bring you lunch?

322
00:20:39.155 --> 00:20:40.156
No need

323
00:21:03.637 --> 00:21:05.598
I'm so pissed off. This outfit actually looks good on me.

324
00:21:07.641 --> 00:21:08.517
(Refresh Car Wash)

325
00:21:08.601 --> 00:21:11.854
According to your maintenance records, everything else is fine.

326
00:21:11.937 --> 00:21:13.564
- Just need to change the oil
- OK

327
00:21:13.647 --> 00:21:15.524
Top up the coolant for this customer

328
00:21:15.608 --> 00:21:16.942
- OK
- very good

329
00:21:17.818 --> 00:21:21.405
It'll be a few hours before you pick up the car anyway

330
00:21:21.906 --> 00:21:23.949
Why don't you do a fine wash?

331
00:21:24.867 --> 00:21:25.743
Fine cleaning?

332
00:21:26.786 --> 00:21:28.829
He used to be the sales director of ACT

333
00:21:28.913 --> 00:21:30.164
Why are you telling your customers this?

334
00:21:31.207 --> 00:21:32.750
Really?

335
00:21:33.793 --> 00:21:34.668
That

336
00:21:35.461 --> 00:21:36.378
OK

337
00:21:36.462 --> 00:21:38.130
OK thank you

338
00:21:41.675 --> 00:21:43.177
(Only three cars washed every day, 50,000 won)

339
00:21:56.440 --> 00:21:58.108
So cool

340
00:22:30.683 --> 00:22:32.101
She checked so carefully

341
00:22:39.942 --> 00:22:42.152
You wash too carefully

342
00:22:42.236 --> 00:22:43.529
Like a new car

343
00:22:44.113 --> 00:22:46.532
Sales depends on details

344
00:22:46.615 --> 00:22:47.741
That's right

345
00:22:48.951 --> 00:22:49.869
How much?

346
00:22:51.453 --> 00:22:53.914
- Fifty thousand won
- OK

347
00:23:02.923 --> 00:23:04.049
I feel weird

348
00:23:05.342 --> 00:23:07.553
Bake it on a stone slab to cook it faster

349
00:23:08.470 --> 00:23:09.680
- boss
- What?

350
00:23:09.763 --> 00:23:11.599
- Please order for two, please.
- OK

351
00:23:12.141 --> 00:23:13.684
eat slowly

352
00:23:13.767 --> 00:23:15.728
Be careful to spit it out

353
00:23:15.811 --> 00:23:17.646
Wash the car once and it will be completely digested

354
00:23:17.730 --> 00:23:18.981
- boss
- What?

355
00:23:19.064 --> 00:23:21.358
How long do we have to wait for the stone noodles we ordered?

356
00:23:21.442 --> 00:23:23.611
- Coming soon
- OK

357
00:23:23.694 --> 00:23:25.905
- Interesting
- What?

358
00:23:26.530 --> 00:23:28.449
You are quite suitable for this job.

359
00:23:28.532 --> 00:23:30.409
Whatever is suitable or not, let’s do it first.

360
00:23:32.036 --> 00:23:32.912
Excuse me

361
00:23:35.331 --> 00:23:36.206
Take a look

362
00:23:36.290 --> 00:23:38.000
- What is this?
- Fried noodles

363
00:23:39.126 --> 00:23:40.210
Your phone is ringing

364
00:23:40.294 --> 00:23:41.211
(Executive Director Bai Zhengtai)

365
00:23:42.296 --> 00:23:44.423
Do you pour it directly on the stone slab?

366
00:23:44.506 --> 00:23:45.382
yes

367
00:23:47.301 --> 00:23:48.177
- Oh my god
- Please use it slowly

368
00:23:55.392 --> 00:23:57.061
So delicious

369
00:23:57.144 --> 00:23:58.896
Tastes great

370
00:23:58.979 --> 00:24:01.023
(Stone Barbecue)

371
00:24:01.649 --> 00:24:03.734
The phone you dialed has been switched off...

372
00:24:03.817 --> 00:24:06.195
This brat is disgusting

373
00:24:12.785 --> 00:24:13.661
hey

374
00:24:14.578 --> 00:24:15.871
Try giving Kim Nak-soo a call.

375
00:24:16.997 --> 00:24:18.791
- Now?
- right now

376
00:24:23.545 --> 00:24:25.673
ok wait a moment

377
00:24:30.761 --> 00:24:33.472
The phone you dialed has been switched off...

378
00:24:33.555 --> 00:24:34.682
Shut down the machine

379
00:24:38.727 --> 00:24:39.895
Have you eaten?

380
00:24:39.979 --> 00:24:41.188
Not yet

381
00:24:41.271 --> 00:24:44.316
How about we eat together, executive?

382
00:24:44.400 --> 00:24:45.317
- Actually...
- that

383
00:24:46.360 --> 00:24:47.861
Use this to get something to eat

384
00:24:48.404 --> 00:24:49.989
I'll stop by the department store on my way back.

385
00:24:50.489 --> 00:24:53.283
Bring me a gift box of short ribs
Ask for the most expensive one

386
00:24:53.367 --> 00:24:54.451
Understand the routine

387
00:24:54.535 --> 00:24:55.619
- That's it
- Yes Standing

388
00:24:55.703 --> 00:24:56.704
Yes standing

389
00:24:58.247 --> 00:25:01.041
Looks like he's going to ask Minister Kim for a big favor

390
00:25:02.001 --> 00:25:03.085
I'll call you later

391
00:25:13.429 --> 00:25:14.513
Oh my god

392
00:25:16.306 --> 00:25:17.391
Minister Kim

393
00:25:23.230 --> 00:25:24.523
your favorite

394
00:25:26.984 --> 00:25:28.444
It's heavy to hold

395
00:25:29.737 --> 00:25:30.612
Why are you here?

396
00:25:30.696 --> 00:25:32.364
you don't answer the phone

397
00:25:32.448 --> 00:25:34.241
Have you ever wondered why I didn’t answer?

398
00:25:35.826 --> 00:25:37.077
thought about

399
00:25:39.747 --> 00:25:41.248
Take it quickly

400
00:25:41.331 --> 00:25:43.083
I don't want it. Take it back.

401
00:25:44.460 --> 00:25:45.711
Look at you

402
00:25:45.794 --> 00:25:48.297
Okay, get in the car then

403
00:25:48.797 --> 00:25:50.549
let's talk a few words

404
00:25:50.632 --> 00:25:52.259
What's there to talk about?

405
00:25:52.342 --> 00:25:54.470
Brat, can you stop being so stubborn?

406
00:25:54.553 --> 00:25:56.346
- Luo Zhu, just chat a few words
- This is already

407
00:25:56.889 --> 00:26:00.559
It’s 20 million won cheaper than the market price.
It really can't go any lower

408
00:26:00.642 --> 00:26:02.936
Are there enough parking spaces here?

409
00:26:03.020 --> 00:26:04.521
Of course

410
00:26:07.858 --> 00:26:11.403
You can find a parking space no matter how late you come back.

411
00:26:12.071 --> 00:26:13.530
- Waiting for your reply
- OK

412
00:26:13.614 --> 00:26:14.490
OK

413
00:26:19.244 --> 00:26:21.663
Long time no see, brothers and sisters

414
00:26:21.747 --> 00:26:23.749
- Hello
- hello

415
00:26:30.422 --> 00:26:32.633
I brought some beef short ribs

416
00:26:32.716 --> 00:26:34.510
Minister Kim’s favorite

417
00:26:35.302 --> 00:26:36.595
thank you

418
00:26:39.807 --> 00:26:42.762
I feel really bad about always accepting gifts.

419
00:26:42.837 --> 00:26:44.686
last time you came

420
00:26:44.770 --> 00:26:47.648
I shouldn't just give you side dishes
I should give you something better.

421
00:26:47.731 --> 00:26:48.857
Where is this?

422
00:26:48.941 --> 00:26:51.527
In that case, you will definitely take it home, right?

423
00:26:52.194 --> 00:26:55.864
And I will take more care of him

424
00:26:55.948 --> 00:26:57.407
Right?

425
00:27:04.456 --> 00:27:06.792
I want

426
00:27:07.751 --> 00:27:09.545
Say a few words to Minister Kim

427
00:27:10.295 --> 00:27:11.547
Where to go?

428
00:27:12.214 --> 00:27:16.301
Let's have some beers nearby

429
00:27:17.010 --> 00:27:20.347
You came all the way here
Why bother drinking outside?

430
00:27:20.430 --> 00:27:22.599
Just go to our house and drink.

431
00:27:27.312 --> 00:27:28.522
That's too intrusive

432
00:27:29.439 --> 00:27:30.983
Luo Zhu, get in the car and let's go

433
00:27:31.650 --> 00:27:32.818
Husband

434
00:27:35.654 --> 00:27:37.156
This is not a matter suitable to be discussed at home

435
00:27:38.448 --> 00:27:39.867
I'll be back as soon as I finish talking

436
00:27:42.786 --> 00:27:44.830
See you later, brothers and sisters

437
00:27:45.622 --> 00:27:47.207
Just accept it

438
00:27:47.833 --> 00:27:48.876
Don't refuse

439
00:27:49.960 --> 00:27:50.836
Take it quickly

440
00:27:51.378 --> 00:27:52.546
Take it

441
00:27:56.216 --> 00:27:57.801
- Luo Su, let's go, get in the car.
- OK

442
00:27:57.885 --> 00:27:59.511
Don't worry, I'll be back in a minute

443
00:27:59.595 --> 00:28:00.762
OK

444
00:28:07.186 --> 00:28:08.103
Then I'll take my leave first.

445
00:28:09.062 --> 00:28:10.397
He'll be back soon

446
00:28:28.624 --> 00:28:30.125
(ACT Building 1, ACT Building 2)

447
00:28:30.209 --> 00:28:32.669
You haven't been here for a long time, haven't you?

448
00:28:34.504 --> 00:28:36.632
I remember when I was still an agent
When you were still a clerk

449
00:28:37.257 --> 00:28:39.676
The two of us have been scolding the company to death here.

450
00:28:40.469 --> 00:28:42.930
We said: "Never become like them"

451
00:28:43.430 --> 00:28:45.807
"We're going to completely transform this broken company."

452
00:28:58.487 --> 00:29:02.491
I came here once after you left the company

453
00:29:03.909 --> 00:29:05.160
until then

454
00:29:05.786 --> 00:29:08.538
I just realized I made a big mistake

455
00:29:10.499 --> 00:29:12.042
Sorry Kim Nak Soo

456
00:29:13.669 --> 00:29:14.544
please forgive me

457
00:29:14.628 --> 00:29:16.672
Why mention the past again?

458
00:29:17.214 --> 00:29:18.590
Forget it

459
00:29:18.674 --> 00:29:21.343
Since you gave up on me, you chose Du Zhenyu
Just be nice to him

460
00:29:22.177 --> 00:29:23.053
Du Zhenyu?

461
00:29:26.431 --> 00:29:29.309
He betrayed me and took refuge with Special Agent Huang Taishan

462
00:29:30.936 --> 00:29:33.981
The three major telecommunications companies I established by myself
The sales head’s golf circle?

463
00:29:34.481 --> 00:29:37.901
Du Zhenyu kicked me away
I let Commissioner Huang take my position

464
00:29:38.652 --> 00:29:40.362
They left me out, damn it.

465
00:29:42.739 --> 00:29:45.200
They obviously want to eat alone

466
00:29:45.284 --> 00:29:48.078
If this continues, my executive's contract renewal may be in doubt.

467
00:29:48.161 --> 00:29:49.955
You just brought it upon yourself

468
00:29:50.038 --> 00:29:51.039
Your team members will also suffer.

469
00:29:52.207 --> 00:29:53.292
Minister?

470
00:29:53.375 --> 00:29:56.670
He cleverly squeezed out one group and kept the pressure on

471
00:29:57.504 --> 00:29:59.089
They won't last long either

472
00:29:59.172 --> 00:30:01.466
Why on earth are you telling me this?

473
00:30:05.012 --> 00:30:05.971
i need your help

474
00:30:06.054 --> 00:30:07.306
How to help?

475
00:30:07.389 --> 00:30:09.766
I have already left the company

476
00:30:09.850 --> 00:30:11.977
Naimo, Taizheng, Abrod

477
00:30:12.602 --> 00:30:14.813
You have a good relationship with the front-line managers of these companies

478
00:30:14.896 --> 00:30:19.318
Enter them into upcoming private network bids

479
00:30:19.401 --> 00:30:21.862
Even if the three major telecommunications companies secretly collude

480
00:30:21.945 --> 00:30:23.405
As long as small and medium-sized enterprises suddenly rush in,

481
00:30:23.488 --> 00:30:25.365
They can't even try to manipulate the winning bid price.

482
00:30:25.449 --> 00:30:27.826
Their bad golf circle or something?
There's no way we can save the Big Three

483
00:30:31.830 --> 00:30:34.583
So you're going to stab yourself in the back

484
00:30:35.625 --> 00:30:38.128
Brother, you are an executive of ACT
How could you have such an idea?

485
00:30:38.211 --> 00:30:41.340
Do not hesitate to harm the company's interests
Do you have to fight hard to keep your position?

486
00:30:41.423 --> 00:30:45.302
I just want to stay in the company for a few more years. What's wrong?

487
00:30:45.385 --> 00:30:46.428
Is this wrong?

488
00:30:46.511 --> 00:30:49.723
Brother, you are just greedy
you've got enough

489
00:30:49.806 --> 00:30:51.558
Which company should I go to?

490
00:30:51.641 --> 00:30:54.269
Let it go. Why make it so ugly?

491
00:30:54.353 --> 00:30:55.312
What's ugly?

492
00:30:55.395 --> 00:30:57.147
You're ugly, brother. You're totally ugly now.

493
00:31:00.400 --> 00:31:01.485
Aren't you?

494
00:31:02.444 --> 00:31:03.987
Haven't you ever thought about being like me?

495
00:31:04.905 --> 00:31:08.492
How strong do you think you can be as a senior executive?

496
00:31:09.618 --> 00:31:12.329
I just admit my desire and want to keep it

497
00:31:13.830 --> 00:31:15.665
What's so ugly about this?

498
00:31:16.958 --> 00:31:19.378
I know you still have it in your heart

499
00:31:20.087 --> 00:31:22.214
Things that can’t be let go

500
00:31:22.297 --> 00:31:25.092
That's why you followed me here

501
00:31:25.175 --> 00:31:26.259
Oh my god

502
00:31:27.010 --> 00:31:28.929
you are just talking nonsense

503
00:31:31.264 --> 00:31:32.265
Luo Su, listen

504
00:31:33.558 --> 00:31:36.603
Seriously, I wouldn't be where I am today without you

505
00:31:37.270 --> 00:31:38.730
I admit

506
00:31:38.814 --> 00:31:41.316
So please help me one last time

507
00:31:42.901 --> 00:31:45.987
If this thing comes to pass, I promise to find a position for you.

508
00:31:46.071 --> 00:31:48.323
Join a small and medium-sized enterprise as a senior executive

509
00:31:48.407 --> 00:31:50.534
Annual salary is at least 150 million won

510
00:31:55.580 --> 00:31:56.957
I keep my word

511
00:31:59.960 --> 00:32:00.919
please

512
00:32:02.504 --> 00:32:03.380
Really

513
00:32:09.553 --> 00:32:11.430
How can I make Tae Jung and the others

514
00:32:12.305 --> 00:32:13.849
Participate in bidding?

515
00:32:13.932 --> 00:32:15.892
Stop talking nonsense

516
00:32:17.352 --> 00:32:18.562
please

517
00:32:19.813 --> 00:32:21.064
Aren’t you very clear?

518
00:32:21.773 --> 00:32:24.985
Either entertain and win over, or find excuses to exert pressure.

519
00:32:25.485 --> 00:32:28.280
or threaten to terminate their contract with ACT

520
00:32:30.449 --> 00:32:33.034
Isn't this what you always asked me to do before?

521
00:32:33.118 --> 00:32:36.705
Luo Zhu, this way both you and I can survive.

522
00:32:36.788 --> 00:32:39.624
Your team members will no longer be squeezed out by Du Zhenyu.

523
00:32:40.292 --> 00:32:42.586
This is a great thing

524
00:32:58.852 --> 00:33:01.646
I told you not to sell the house
Why are you bringing people to see the house?

525
00:33:01.730 --> 00:33:03.231
You answer me first

526
00:33:04.065 --> 00:33:06.193
What did Executive Bai say?
What tricks did he get you into?

527
00:33:08.236 --> 00:33:09.696
Don't go. You hear me?

528
00:33:11.448 --> 00:33:13.617
Everyone who came to see the house today was very interested.

529
00:33:13.700 --> 00:33:14.868
Tell me to reply tomorrow

530
00:33:14.951 --> 00:33:17.496
In this way we can overcome the biggest difficulty

531
00:33:18.121 --> 00:33:19.831
You don't have to force yourself

532
00:33:19.915 --> 00:33:23.335
Even if you sell the house and pay off the loan on the shop,

533
00:33:23.835 --> 00:33:25.378
So where will we live in the future?

534
00:33:26.046 --> 00:33:27.506
You must have thought about it

535
00:33:29.716 --> 00:33:31.426
Low-rise apartments in Gyeonggi-do

536
00:33:31.510 --> 00:33:32.511
Monthly rent?

537
00:33:34.095 --> 00:33:35.597
Yes monthly rental

538
00:33:36.139 --> 00:33:38.767
Given our current situation, are there any options?

539
00:33:43.522 --> 00:33:45.982
It's your turn to answer me

540
00:33:46.066 --> 00:33:47.526
Will you cooperate with Executive Bai?

541
00:33:50.570 --> 00:33:53.406
Answer me, will you cooperate with Executive Bai?

542
00:33:58.078 --> 00:33:59.704
answer me!

543
00:34:00.497 --> 00:34:02.624
Okay, I can't

544
00:34:05.126 --> 00:34:07.003
I said no, okay?

545
00:34:07.546 --> 00:34:09.965
Throw this thing away

546
00:34:19.140 --> 00:34:22.644
There was a passenger who drank too much during the day and was making a lot of noise.

547
00:34:22.727 --> 00:34:25.313
I was so scared that I hit the guardrail.

548
00:34:25.397 --> 00:34:27.232
It was so dangerous. Something serious almost happened. Were you not injured?

549
00:34:27.315 --> 00:34:28.900
I'm fine

550
00:34:29.526 --> 00:34:31.069
- Will it take a long time to repair?
- No

551
00:34:31.152 --> 00:34:32.821
We'll fix it as soon as possible to make sure you can use the car tonight

552
00:34:32.904 --> 00:34:33.780
- OK
- OK

553
00:34:34.489 --> 00:34:37.742
OK, I'll check the other parts

554
00:34:37.826 --> 00:34:38.827
It looks fine here

555
00:34:41.955 --> 00:34:42.831
Oh my god

556
00:34:44.207 --> 00:34:48.420
I don't know what he ate. The smell is really...

557
00:34:48.503 --> 00:34:50.922
Anyway, please hurry up.

558
00:34:51.006 --> 00:34:52.465
I haven't received my money for this month yet.

559
00:34:52.549 --> 00:34:54.092
Oh my god

560
00:34:55.051 --> 00:34:56.177
Don't worry, I'll take care of it

561
00:34:56.261 --> 00:34:59.306
Are you sure? That’ll be your hard work.

562
00:34:59.389 --> 00:35:00.307
thank you

563
00:35:00.390 --> 00:35:02.684
Yongji, bring the wrench. Hurry up.

564
00:35:03.435 --> 00:35:05.812
Reset quickly

565
00:35:20.910 --> 00:35:22.495
- thank you
- thank you

566
00:35:22.579 --> 00:35:24.539
- You walk slowly
- Drive carefully

567
00:35:30.545 --> 00:35:31.796
Hey everyone, thank you for your hard work

568
00:35:31.880 --> 00:35:33.798
- Go to eat
- You go ahead

569
00:35:34.549 --> 00:35:36.343
Do you want to buy you kimbap?

570
00:35:36.426 --> 00:35:37.552
I have no appetite

571
00:35:39.763 --> 00:35:41.389
Okay, you take a break

572
00:35:42.974 --> 00:35:44.392
- let's go
- He won't eat?

573
00:35:44.476 --> 00:35:45.769
How could he possibly eat it?

574
00:35:45.852 --> 00:35:47.437
- You go ahead
- OK

575
00:35:47.520 --> 00:35:48.855
See you later

576
00:35:55.487 --> 00:35:56.696
(Agent Zheng Chengjiu)

577
00:36:00.450 --> 00:36:01.701
Boss, aren't you coming?

578
00:36:02.243 --> 00:36:03.536
let's go

579
00:36:06.790 --> 00:36:07.666
Hello Chengjiu

580
00:36:07.749 --> 00:36:09.834
- Minister!
- Oh my god, that scared me.

581
00:36:10.585 --> 00:36:13.213
- Where are you, Minister?
- Why do you ask?

582
00:36:13.296 --> 00:36:16.424
We happen to be outside now

583
00:36:16.508 --> 00:36:18.176
As we chatted, we mentioned that we miss you very much.

584
00:36:18.259 --> 00:36:19.427
want to visit you

585
00:36:19.511 --> 00:36:21.179
Why are you looking for me? Aren't you busy?

586
00:36:21.262 --> 00:36:23.598
That's right. We're not busy at all.

587
00:36:23.682 --> 00:36:24.974
We miss you, Minister.

588
00:36:25.475 --> 00:36:27.268
Minister, if it is convenient for you

589
00:36:27.352 --> 00:36:29.646
we want to visit you

590
00:36:29.729 --> 00:36:31.272
There's something I want to tell you

591
00:36:43.451 --> 00:36:45.245
- I went to eat
- OK

592
00:36:45.328 --> 00:36:46.454
Enjoy your meal

593
00:36:46.538 --> 00:36:47.831
Enjoy your meal

594
00:36:49.874 --> 00:36:51.251
Aren't you going to eat?

595
00:36:51.334 --> 00:36:52.961
I actually

596
00:36:53.712 --> 00:36:55.338
Brought food

597
00:36:55.422 --> 00:36:57.590
God, you really know how to live.

598
00:36:58.800 --> 00:37:01.261
Let's have a chat before you eat.

599
00:37:02.262 --> 00:37:03.471
OK

600
00:37:09.686 --> 00:37:10.687
Can you understand?

601
00:37:11.813 --> 00:37:13.940
Wait, but why?

602
00:37:14.023 --> 00:37:17.360
Studio and two-bedroom apartments that our office is responsible for

603
00:37:17.444 --> 00:37:18.987
I signed half of them

604
00:37:19.654 --> 00:37:20.697
i know

605
00:37:20.780 --> 00:37:23.992
I've never defaulted on a commission
I call you on time every time

606
00:37:25.952 --> 00:37:27.912
What you said is really interesting.

607
00:37:28.913 --> 00:37:29.914
What's wrong with me?

608
00:37:30.540 --> 00:37:33.376
You make it sound like I took money that I shouldn't have taken

609
00:37:33.460 --> 00:37:35.587
I deserve this money

610
00:37:36.212 --> 00:37:39.674
It was me who climbed up the hill to show people the houses.
Have a good talk with the landlord

611
00:37:39.758 --> 00:37:42.177
I also drafted the contract
I handle everything from start to finish

612
00:37:43.595 --> 00:37:46.181
And I am only responsible for paying the rent and paying for water, electricity and miscellaneous bills.

613
00:37:46.264 --> 00:37:49.350
Spend money to advertise and register the property, that’s it.

614
00:37:49.434 --> 00:37:50.560
sorry

615
00:37:50.643 --> 00:37:53.897
If you feel so wronged
It's better to find a place to do it yourself

616
00:37:53.980 --> 00:37:55.356
You can definitely do a good job

617
00:37:59.402 --> 00:38:01.196
OK I understand

618
00:38:01.821 --> 00:38:03.656
So today is my last day at work?

619
00:38:03.740 --> 00:38:06.576
Yes thanks for understanding

620
00:38:06.659 --> 00:38:07.702
Enjoy your meal

621
00:38:07.786 --> 00:38:09.829
before leaving

622
00:38:10.330 --> 00:38:13.249
I want a clear settlement statement

623
00:38:14.584 --> 00:38:15.460
Why?

624
00:38:15.543 --> 00:38:19.297
Something to check
Isn’t this request too much?

625
00:38:20.965 --> 00:38:21.966
OK

626
00:38:24.469 --> 00:38:25.929
to you

627
00:38:27.263 --> 00:38:28.848
- Use slowly
- Use slowly

628
00:38:28.932 --> 00:38:29.808
Use slowly

629
00:38:45.448 --> 00:38:47.075
Why do you always look so speechless?

630
00:38:47.158 --> 00:38:48.368
What? No

631
00:38:51.287 --> 00:38:52.497
What do you want to say?

632
00:38:53.289 --> 00:38:54.290
Just say it

633
00:38:56.751 --> 00:38:57.627
minister

634
00:38:58.837 --> 00:39:00.588
Have you met Executive Bai?

635
00:39:02.882 --> 00:39:04.008
How do you know?

636
00:39:04.092 --> 00:39:06.803
I picked that box of beef short ribs.

637
00:39:06.886 --> 00:39:07.929
That's right

638
00:39:10.890 --> 00:39:12.600
What did he say?

639
00:39:13.893 --> 00:39:16.896
It's nothing. You just want me to do a little favor at work.

640
00:39:16.980 --> 00:39:18.982
- So what's your decision?
- Hey

641
00:39:19.899 --> 00:39:21.317
Is Du Zhenyu giving you a hard time?

642
00:39:23.903 --> 00:39:24.904
Really?

643
00:39:27.323 --> 00:39:28.658
Ouch

644
00:39:28.741 --> 00:39:30.410
I think the purpose of Minister Dou is to

645
00:39:30.493 --> 00:39:33.705
Replace us with new people and form next year's sales department.

646
00:39:35.456 --> 00:39:38.293
Minister, are you busy with work recently?

647
00:39:39.252 --> 00:39:40.211
What's wrong?

648
00:39:40.295 --> 00:39:43.214
I don’t know what kind of help Executive Bai is asking you for.

649
00:39:43.298 --> 00:39:46.801
but no matter what
It must be something you have to do

650
00:39:46.885 --> 00:39:48.720
Only you can do it

651
00:39:49.804 --> 00:39:52.181
You might as well try it

652
00:39:52.807 --> 00:39:54.934
It might bring new opportunities

653
00:39:55.768 --> 00:39:57.645
And just in case

654
00:39:58.271 --> 00:40:00.815
- This matter has something to do with us...
- Chengjiu

655
00:40:02.025 --> 00:40:03.610
I'm just saying

656
00:40:04.944 --> 00:40:07.530
Before you make a decision, please consider us.

657
00:40:08.364 --> 00:40:10.575
I just want to be like before

658
00:40:10.658 --> 00:40:13.453
I hope we can all still work together

659
00:40:14.454 --> 00:40:15.580
minister

660
00:40:18.541 --> 00:40:19.751
Eat

661
00:40:29.093 --> 00:40:31.095
What are you going to do about this?

662
00:40:31.179 --> 00:40:33.264
Do you know how much these leather seats cost?

663
00:40:33.348 --> 00:40:34.474
What's wrong?

664
00:40:34.557 --> 00:40:35.767
I made a little mistake

665
00:40:35.850 --> 00:40:36.726
What?

666
00:40:37.226 --> 00:40:38.353
Ouch

667
00:40:38.853 --> 00:40:40.897
Boss, I'm really sorry

668
00:40:40.980 --> 00:40:42.649
- Haojun, go get the leather cleaner
- What?

669
00:40:42.732 --> 00:40:44.025
- OK
- Can it be wiped off?

670
00:40:44.108 --> 00:40:45.568
If it can't be wiped off

671
00:40:45.652 --> 00:40:47.862
I'll find a professional or think of other ways

672
00:40:47.946 --> 00:40:49.906
I'm really sorry

673
00:40:54.077 --> 00:40:55.161
Hey Nok Soo

674
00:40:55.703 --> 00:40:56.663
sorry

675
00:40:56.746 --> 00:40:59.290
How can someone in the service industry be so unprofessional?

676
00:40:59.374 --> 00:41:00.583
- Boss to you
- thank you

677
00:41:00.667 --> 00:41:02.168
Go get a wet sponge

678
00:41:02.251 --> 00:41:03.503
- It's the boss
- OK

679
00:41:03.586 --> 00:41:05.838
I'll be responsible for restoring it to its original state, so...

680
00:41:05.922 --> 00:41:07.966
- Wipe it off quickly
- It's the boss

681
00:41:08.049 --> 00:41:09.300
- Hey Haojun...
- I'm so unlucky today

682
00:41:09.384 --> 00:41:10.301
I'll do it

683
00:41:10.385 --> 00:41:11.844
No, just go and sit over there.

684
00:41:11.928 --> 00:41:14.097
- You go in first
- But...

685
00:41:27.443 --> 00:41:29.779
Naimo, Taizheng, Abrod

686
00:41:29.862 --> 00:41:34.283
Enter them into upcoming private network bids

687
00:41:34.909 --> 00:41:38.246
If this thing comes to pass, I promise to find a position for you.

688
00:41:43.876 --> 00:41:46.212
(Director Zheng Bingyu, Naimo Communications)

689
00:41:46.295 --> 00:41:47.797
(Representative of Abrod Jang Kwon Hyuk)

690
00:41:47.880 --> 00:41:49.465
I have their contact information

691
00:41:50.717 --> 00:41:53.011
(Taizheng Telecom
Deputy Chief Heo Tae-hwan, Section Chief Hong Hyun-joon)

692
00:41:54.846 --> 00:41:55.930
I have them all

693
00:42:18.077 --> 00:42:20.288
You said I could get my share

694
00:42:25.668 --> 00:42:27.003
Really

695
00:42:31.966 --> 00:42:32.842
That's not...

696
00:42:32.925 --> 00:42:33.968
What's wrong?

697
00:42:34.927 --> 00:42:35.970
What happened?

698
00:42:37.346 --> 00:42:40.266
How many times do you want me to say this? I really admire this aunt

699
00:42:40.349 --> 00:42:41.893
How can I help you?

700
00:42:41.976 --> 00:42:43.144
Wife, what happened?

701
00:42:43.227 --> 00:42:44.937
wait a moment

702
00:42:45.438 --> 00:42:48.608
you never said
You have to deduct the fee from my commission?

703
00:42:48.691 --> 00:42:49.901
How many times have I said this

704
00:42:49.984 --> 00:42:53.946
As usual, water, electricity, miscellaneous expenses and advertising expenses must be shared

705
00:42:54.030 --> 00:42:56.991
It means you get 60%
Isn’t it already included?

706
00:42:57.075 --> 00:42:59.577
Have you never drank the water from the water dispenser?

707
00:42:59.660 --> 00:43:00.620
Never used a printer?

708
00:43:00.703 --> 00:43:03.831
You should at least tell me in advance
There is no such clause in the contract

709
00:43:03.915 --> 00:43:06.250
I'm convinced. This aunt is really speechless.

710
00:43:06.334 --> 00:43:09.253
Then give me the details of the additional charges.

711
00:43:09.337 --> 00:43:11.798
- I have to figure it out before I can pay.
- This aunt is real!

712
00:43:11.881 --> 00:43:14.884
I think you're pitiful. I'll hire you even if you're young.
Is this how you repay a favor?

713
00:43:14.967 --> 00:43:17.220
"Young enough"? Hey, please be careful what you say. That's enough.

714
00:43:17.303 --> 00:43:19.472
- Wife, stop arguing. Let’s go.
- Okay, I won't argue anymore.

715
00:43:19.555 --> 00:43:21.224
- wait a minute
- What's wrong?

716
00:43:21.724 --> 00:43:23.434
"Favor"? What kind of favor?

717
00:43:23.518 --> 00:43:25.895
I work my ass off for you

718
00:43:25.978 --> 00:43:27.897
Is it wrong to ask for my fair share?

719
00:43:27.980 --> 00:43:30.274
- Get out!
- Don't touch her!

720
00:43:30.358 --> 00:43:32.777
Stop worrying! Get out of here!

721
00:43:32.860 --> 00:43:34.654
- Get out!
- Stop it, wife!

722
00:43:34.737 --> 00:43:36.197
- Oh my God!
- I'm not going out

723
00:43:36.280 --> 00:43:38.199
I will never leave until I get what I deserve.

724
00:43:38.282 --> 00:43:40.535
I endure it again and again, but you push yourself even further

725
00:43:40.618 --> 00:43:42.620
Makes me look like a black-hearted boss!

726
00:43:42.703 --> 00:43:43.663
Oh my God, stop it!

727
00:43:45.706 --> 00:43:47.750
- Let go!
- You let go!

728
00:43:48.251 --> 00:43:49.710
Wife, get out quickly!

729
00:43:55.550 --> 00:43:58.136
It's really disgusting that it ended like this.

730
00:43:58.803 --> 00:44:00.596
How much does she owe you?

731
00:44:01.264 --> 00:44:02.974
About one million won

732
00:44:03.933 --> 00:44:04.809
One million?

733
00:44:04.892 --> 00:44:07.520
No matter what, I want to get this money back

734
00:44:09.355 --> 00:44:10.773
Forget it

735
00:44:11.691 --> 00:44:14.110
Forget it? That’s a whole million won!

736
00:44:17.280 --> 00:44:18.990
Ouch, it’s true

737
00:44:20.741 --> 00:44:22.243
I'm so angry

738
00:44:32.962 --> 00:44:35.631
Have you been contacted by people who came to view the property before?

739
00:44:38.134 --> 00:44:41.679
Yeah, I've decided to sign a contract with the person I contacted first.

740
00:44:41.762 --> 00:44:43.097
Everything is arranged

741
00:44:43.806 --> 00:44:44.724
Why do you ask?

742
00:44:46.350 --> 00:44:47.393
send them message

743
00:44:47.977 --> 00:44:49.312
Said the transaction was canceled

744
00:44:50.646 --> 00:44:52.231
We neither sell nor rent

745
00:44:53.065 --> 00:44:54.650
I want to keep this house

746
00:45:03.534 --> 00:45:04.619
How to keep it?

747
00:45:05.870 --> 00:45:07.371
I want to cooperate with Executive Bai

748
00:45:15.254 --> 00:45:17.590
So that’s why you came to me today

749
00:45:18.424 --> 00:45:21.552
I don't want to shout loudly at home anymore

750
00:45:21.636 --> 00:45:23.930
This is the home we want to live in for a long time

751
00:45:25.598 --> 00:45:26.974
Why?

752
00:45:27.516 --> 00:45:29.727
Why do you want to hang out with Executive Bai again?

753
00:45:30.603 --> 00:45:31.687
Why?

754
00:45:32.521 --> 00:45:33.940
no reason

755
00:45:34.023 --> 00:45:36.067
Now is not the time to be picky

756
00:45:36.150 --> 00:45:40.071
If you do this, sooner or later you will be betrayed again
Do you want to go through the pain again?

757
00:45:46.744 --> 00:45:48.579
Is it so important to keep this house?

758
00:45:49.538 --> 00:45:51.916
What does it mean to you?
Just an apartment

759
00:45:51.999 --> 00:45:53.542
It's just a cement shell

760
00:45:54.418 --> 00:45:57.296
Why should you sacrifice yourself to keep it?

761
00:45:58.839 --> 00:46:00.091
this is not a sacrifice

762
00:46:01.259 --> 00:46:02.927
you don't understand anything

763
00:46:04.303 --> 00:46:08.099
Yeah, that sounds great. Renting in the suburbs.

764
00:46:08.182 --> 00:46:11.727
Go to my brother's garage to wash the car
Save money bit by bit

765
00:46:11.811 --> 00:46:14.146
Our family of three works together to cheer each other up

766
00:46:14.230 --> 00:46:17.316
I grit my teeth and endure it until the day I can move back to Seoul.

767
00:46:18.234 --> 00:46:19.735
This sounds wonderful

768
00:46:19.819 --> 00:46:20.695
yes

769
00:46:21.279 --> 00:46:24.156
Isn’t it okay for us to do this? What’s the problem?

770
00:46:24.240 --> 00:46:25.616
I'm old

771
00:46:28.327 --> 00:46:30.204
I'm old and tired. I'm exhausted.

772
00:46:34.417 --> 00:46:35.334
Wife

773
00:46:36.127 --> 00:46:39.463
Do you really think I can survive in that kind of environment?

774
00:46:41.882 --> 00:46:45.344
Living in a shabby, cramped low-rise apartment

775
00:46:46.095 --> 00:46:50.099
I think about it every night
That damn store I bought

776
00:46:50.182 --> 00:46:53.686
I feel so guilty about you and Soo Gyeom.

777
00:46:53.769 --> 00:46:55.104
Can't sleep at all

778
00:46:55.187 --> 00:46:57.815
It's going to be like that. I'm going to collapse.

779
00:46:57.898 --> 00:47:00.443
That’s why I fought so hard to avoid that day coming

780
00:47:00.526 --> 00:47:02.903
Why don't you understand?

781
00:47:11.829 --> 00:47:12.788
Very good

782
00:47:15.499 --> 00:47:16.876
Finally told the truth

783
00:47:19.128 --> 00:47:20.004
After all

784
00:47:20.671 --> 00:47:23.674
You're not trying to keep the house at all

785
00:47:26.052 --> 00:47:27.053
when you wash your car

786
00:47:27.970 --> 00:47:31.557
Are you feeling aggrieved in your heart?

787
00:47:32.683 --> 00:47:34.310
Thinking: "I am Minister Kim

788
00:47:34.393 --> 00:47:37.063
This is not what I’m supposed to do” right?

789
00:47:39.065 --> 00:47:43.277
Talking about guarding the house and protecting us are all excuses.

790
00:47:45.988 --> 00:47:47.573
What you really want to keep

791
00:47:48.449 --> 00:47:50.701
It's just your poor self-esteem

792
00:48:02.588 --> 00:48:03.464
Hello

793
00:48:05.549 --> 00:48:07.426
Do you think you are the only one who is getting older?

794
00:48:34.787 --> 00:48:37.706
Boss, let me have another bottle of soju

795
00:48:38.207 --> 00:48:39.083
OK

796
00:48:39.166 --> 00:48:41.419
- thank you
- Thank you. Welcome to come again next time.

797
00:48:41.502 --> 00:48:42.545
Goodbye

798
00:48:44.422 --> 00:48:45.548
- boss
- What?

799
00:48:45.631 --> 00:48:46.924
Another bottle of soju

800
00:48:49.427 --> 00:48:50.678
- Sir?
- What?

801
00:48:50.761 --> 00:48:51.846
Sorry, we're closed

802
00:48:51.929 --> 00:48:53.722
- Why?
- We're closed.

803
00:48:56.809 --> 00:48:59.019
What's the rent here?

804
00:49:00.104 --> 00:49:02.690
- About six or seven million?
- Hey Jungho

805
00:49:03.315 --> 00:49:04.859
Do you want to settle in my shop?

806
00:49:04.942 --> 00:49:07.653
- You can say whatever you want
- Free rent for the first three months

807
00:49:09.196 --> 00:49:10.739
